        "audio_volume": 0.75,
        "audio_start_delay": 0.0,
        "music": "",
        "music_volume": 0.4,
        "music_start_delay": 0.0,
        "subtitle": "The Affrancian chief savored their victory to the fullest. For him and his priests, this meant that the thunder god meant for them to achieve great things."
      },
      {
        "image": "../../Downloads/M1C2I2.png",
        "camera_a": {
          "x": 42.14586466165406,
          "y": 54.3593984962406,
          "width": 679.6586466165414,
          "height": 382.3079887218046,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "camera_b": {
          "x": 229.05263157894728,
          "y": 171.22791353383474,
          "width": 1318.1112781954887,
          "height": 741.4375939849624,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "pan_duration": 11.5,
        "crossfade_duration": 1.0,
        "easing": "linear",
        "audio": "../../Downloads/M1C2I2V.mp3",
        "audio_volume": 0.65,
        "audio_start_delay": 0.0,
        "music": "",
        "music_volume": 0.4,
        "music_start_delay": 0.0,
        "subtitle": "For the common people, though, war has become a new reality. Every day came with new struggles and new conflicts. And this was not going away."
      },
      {
        "image": "../../Downloads/M1C2I3.png",
        "camera_a": {
          "x": 48.30526315789473,
          "y": 169.8481203007519,
          "width": 567.2496240601504,
          "height": 319.0779135338346,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "camera_b": {
          "x": 30.412030075187886,
          "y": 42.89238721804509,
          "width": 1482.8751879699248,
          "height": 834.1172932330827,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "pan_duration": 6.0,
        "crossfade_duration": 1.0,
        "easing": "linear",
        "audio": "../../Downloads/M1C2I3V.mp3",
        "audio_volume": 0.75,
        "audio_start_delay": 0.0,
        "music": "",
        "music_volume": 0.4,
        "music_start_delay": 0.0,
        "subtitle": "As the chiefs have tasted victory; and they thirst for more."
      }
    ]
  },
  "mission_2_intro": {
    "slides": [
      {
        "image": "../../Downloads/M2C1I1.png",
        "camera_a": {
          "x": 95.9122807017543,
          "y": 409.35087719298247,
          "width": 1206.5438596491229,
          "height": 678.6809210526317,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "camera_b": {
          "x": 2524.0701754385964,
          "y": 2049.253289473684,
          "width": 1509.3508771929828,
          "height": 849.0098684210528,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "pan_duration": 8.0,
        "crossfade_duration": 1.0,
        "easing": "ease_in_out",
        "audio": "../../Downloads/M2C1I1V.mp3",
        "audio_volume": 0.75,
        "audio_start_delay": 0.0,
        "music": "",
        "music_volume": 0.4,
        "music_start_delay": 0.0,
        "subtitle": "Far to the southeast of the Affrancian lands, another region was beset by a growing conflict."
      },
      {
        "image": "../../Downloads/M2C1I2.png",
        "camera_a": {
          "x": 176.11278195488705,
          "y": 46.66015037593979,
          "width": 667.3398496240603,
          "height": 375.37866541353395,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "camera_b": {
          "x": 142.82105263157882,
          "y": 125.27434210526303,
          "width": 1345.8285714285716,
          "height": 757.0285714285716,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "pan_duration": 11.5,
        "crossfade_duration": 1.0,
        "easing": "linear",
        "audio": "../../Downloads/M2C1I2V.mp3",
        "audio_volume": 0.754,
        "audio_start_delay": 0.0,
        "music": "",
        "music_volume": 0.4,
        "music_start_delay": 0.0,
        "subtitle": "The lands of the southeastern peninsula were vast, green hills that cultivated all forms of life. They became known for their great abundance of horses."
      },
      {
        "image": "../../Downloads/M2C1I3.png",
        "camera_a": {
          "x": 392.2766917293234,
          "y": 265.874060150376,
          "width": 774.5443609022557,
          "height": 435.68120300751883,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "camera_b": {
          "x": 168.99849624060153,
          "y": 152.85864661654125,
          "width": 1267.2962406015038,
          "height": 712.8541353383459,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "pan_duration": 12.5,
        "crossfade_duration": 1.0,
        "easing": "linear",
        "audio": "../../Downloads/M2C1I3V.mp3",
        "audio_volume": 0.75,
        "audio_start_delay": 0.0,
        "music": "",
        "music_volume": 0.4,
        "music_start_delay": 0.0,
        "subtitle": "Lobards, the tribe that was leading in domestication of these animals, were a scattered group, dominated by family politics and pursuit of fortune and glory."
      },
      {
        "image": "../../Downloads/M2C1I4.png",
        "camera_a": {
          "x": 17.96491228070181,
          "y": 364.45029239766063,
          "width": 910.2222222222222,
          "height": 512.0,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "camera_b": {
          "x": 383.25146198830396,
          "y": 78.50877192982446,
          "width": 546.6315789473687,
          "height": 307.4802631578949,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "pan_duration": 15.5,
        "crossfade_duration": 1.0,
        "easing": "linear",
        "audio": "../../Downloads/M2C1I4V.mp3",
        "audio_volume": 0.75,
        "audio_start_delay": 0.0,
        "music": "",
        "music_volume": 0.4,
        "music_start_delay": 0.0,
        "subtitle": "One of them, lord Venderfornet, took it upon himself to unify the scattered Lobards. He challenged his brothers one by one and slew them all in combat, finally unifying the tribe under his own rule."
      },
      {
        "image": "../../Downloads/M2C1I5.png",
        "camera_a": {
          "x": 265.4240601503759,
          "y": 37.4210526315789,
          "width": 759.7308270676692,
          "height": 427.34859022556395,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "camera_b": {
          "x": 35.03568179708509,
          "y": 61.39784182678898,
          "width": 1473.3129119094033,
          "height": 828.7385129490394,
          "rotation": 0.0
        },
        "pan_duration": 9.0,
        "crossfade_duration": 1.0,
        "easing": "linear",
        "audio": "../../Downloads/M2C1I5V.mp3",
        "audio_volume": 0.75,
        "audio_start_delay": 0.0,
        "music": "",
        "music_volume": 0.4,
        "music_start_delay": 0.0,
        "subtitle": "His victory, however, was only the first of his house's great feats. For the Lobards would soon become the nightmare of the entire southeast."
      }
    ]
  },
