        },
        "pan_duration": 8.5,
        "crossfade_duration": 1.0,
        "easing": "linear",
        "audio": "assets/cutscenes/M2C2I2V.mp3",
        "audio_volume": 0.75,
        "audio_start_delay": 0.0,
        "music": "",
        "music_volume": 0.4,
        "music_start_delay": 0.0,
        "subtitle": "the coalition against the Lobards led by the Valeonians managed to score several critical victories against their foes."
      },
      {
        "image": "assets/cutscenes/M2C2I3.png",
        "camera_a": {
          "x": 76.02255639097746,
          "y": 72.83759398496241,
          "width": 921,
          "height": 518,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "camera_b": {
          "x": 90.46616541353387,
          "y": 52.888721804511306,
          "width": 1422.821052631579,
          "height": 800.3368421052633,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "pan_duration": 13.0,
        "crossfade_duration": 1.0,
        "easing": "linear",
        "audio": "assets/cutscenes/M2C2I3V.mp3",
        "audio_volume": 0.75,
        "audio_start_delay": 0.0,
        "music": "",
        "music_volume": 0.4,
        "music_start_delay": 0.0,
        "subtitle": "Soon, the Lobards were forced to surrender their war-like paths and give up their conquered territories - giving rise to the kingdom of Valeonia as the primary power of the east."
      }
    ]
  },
  "mission_3_intro": {
    "slides": [
      {
        "image": "assets/cutscenes/M3C1I1.png",
        "camera_a": {
          "x": 338.9112781954887,
          "y": 138.52302631578954,
          "width": 375.72330827067657,
          "height": 211.34436090225557,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "camera_b": {
          "x": 59.646616541353524,
          "y": 80.60601503759403,
          "width": 1344.2045112781955,
          "height": 756.115037593985,
          "rotation": 0.0
        },
        "pan_duration": 8.0,
        "crossfade_duration": 1.0,
        "easing": "linear",
        "audio": "assets/cutscenes/M3C1I1V.mp3",
        "audio_volume": 0.75,
        "audio_start_delay": 0.0,
        "music": "",
        "music_volume": 0.4,
        "music_start_delay": 0.0,
        "subtitle": "In the centuries following the Affrancian conquest, the kingdom established itself as the prominent power of the west."
      },
      {
        "image": "assets/cutscenes/M3C1I2.png",
        "camera_a": {
          "x": 340.8766917293233,
          "y": 103.63458646616542,
          "width": 921,
          "height": 518,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "camera_b": {
          "x": 148.95789473684226,
          "y": 106.78345864661651,
          "width": 1299.6556390977444,
          "height": 731.0562969924813,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "pan_duration": 12.5,
        "crossfade_duration": 1.0,
        "easing": "linear",
        "audio": "assets/cutscenes/M3C1I2V.mp3",
        "audio_volume": 0.75,
        "audio_start_delay": 0.0,
        "music": "",
        "music_volume": 0.4,
        "music_start_delay": 0.0,
        "subtitle": "However, corruption and opulence grew like a tumor within the nobility. The kingdom has become a symbol of royal power, even though its power began to diminish."
      },
      {
        "image": "assets/cutscenes/M3C1I3.png",
        "camera_a": {
          "x": 365.51428571428573,
          "y": 245.3007518796992,
          "width": 921,
          "height": 518,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "camera_b": {
          "x": 8.854135338345941,
          "y": 60.79313909774453,
          "width": 1513.6721804511278,
          "height": 851.4406015037595,
          "rotation": 0.0
        },
        "pan_duration": 11.5,
        "crossfade_duration": 1.0,
        "easing": "linear",
        "audio": "assets/cutscenes/M3C1I3V.mp3",
        "audio_volume": 0.75,
        "audio_start_delay": 0.0,
        "music": "",
        "music_volume": 0.4,
        "music_start_delay": 0.0,
        "subtitle": "At this time, a popular Affrancian general, Serthus Diarcess, began to rally his many followers to overthrow the corrupt monarchy."
      },
      {
        "image": "assets/cutscenes/M3C1I4.png",
        "camera_a": {
          "x": 80.64210526315787,
          "y": 60.518796992481185,
          "width": 921,
          "height": 518,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "camera_b": {
          "x": 23.716791979949676,
          "y": 36.495343296513056,
          "width": 1493.7590705157959,
          "height": 840.2394771651352,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "pan_duration": 14.5,
        "crossfade_duration": 1.0,
        "easing": "linear",
        "audio": "assets/cutscenes/M3C1I4V.mp3",
        "audio_volume": 0.75,
        "audio_start_delay": 0.0,
        "music": "",
        "music_volume": 0.4,
        "music_start_delay": 0.0,
        "subtitle": "Unable to remove him due to his popularity, the royal family sent Serthus on a mission to conquer the Zjoal islands. Knowing this to be an exile, he called upon his numerous followers to accompany him."
      },
      {
        "image": "assets/cutscenes/M3C1I5.png",
        "camera_a": {
          "x": 458.4902255639098,
          "y": 383.87998120300773,
          "width": 651.3563909774437,
          "height": 366.38796992481207,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "camera_b": {
          "x": 96.09356931423213,
          "y": 202.67484142454924,
          "width": 1356.0815619295151,
          "height": 762.7958785853523,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "pan_duration": 11.0,
        "crossfade_duration": 1.0,
        "easing": "linear",
        "audio": "assets/cutscenes/M3C1I5V.mp3",
        "audio_volume": 0.75,
        "audio_start_delay": 0.0,
        "music": "",
        "music_volume": 0.4,
        "music_start_delay": 0.0,
        "subtitle": "He swiftly took over the isles and used them as a staging ground for his forces. Then, he set his eyes eastwards - towards the lands of Affrancia and beyond."
      }
    ]
  },
  "mission_3_outro": {
    "slides": [
      {
        "image": "assets/cutscenes/M3C2I1.png",
        "camera_a": {
          "x": 433.2676691729322,
