        "audio_start_delay": 0.0,
        "music": "",
        "music_volume": 0.4,
        "music_start_delay": 0.0,
        "subtitle": "Serthus Diarcess sat upon the throne of the Zjoal Empire for three decades. He led many conquests and reforms, solidifying the empire's place in the world."
      },
      {
        "image": "assets/cutscenes/M3C2I2.png",
        "camera_a": {
          "x": 513.9624060150377,
          "y": 7.158176691729295,
          "width": 937.7684210526315,
          "height": 527.4947368421052,
          "rotation": 0.0
        },
        "camera_b": {
          "x": 145.93834586466164,
          "y": 296.1849624060151,
          "width": 1224.1804511278197,
          "height": 688.6015037593986,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "pan_duration": 11.0,
        "crossfade_duration": 1.0,
        "easing": "linear",
        "audio": "assets/cutscenes/M3C2I2V.mp3",
        "audio_volume": 0.75,
        "audio_start_delay": 0.0,
        "music": "",
        "music_volume": 0.4,
        "music_start_delay": 0.0,
        "subtitle": "But even great emperors do not live forever. Despite his death, the Zjoal empire grew further; an effort led by the emperor's sons."
      },
      {
        "image": "assets/cutscenes/M3C2I3.png",
        "camera_a": {
          "x": 852.6917293233083,
          "y": 532.867669172932,
          "width": 645.1969924812032,
          "height": 362.92330827067684,
          "rotation": 0.0
        },
        "camera_b": {
          "x": 244.4511278195489,
          "y": -0.7046052631581006,
          "width": 1059.4165413533835,
          "height": 595.9218045112783,
          "rotation": 0.0
        },
        "pan_duration": 13.0,
        "crossfade_duration": 1.0,
        "easing": "linear",
        "audio": "assets/cutscenes/M3C2I3V.mp3",
        "audio_volume": 0.75,
        "audio_start_delay": 0.0,
        "music": "",
        "music_volume": 0.4,
        "music_start_delay": 0.0,
        "subtitle": "During the reign of Serthus's grandson, Aertei, the Empire reached its greatest extent, even besieging and conquering the eastern cities of Daurels, Welthorne and Meladar."
      },
      {
        "image": "assets/cutscenes/M3C2I4.png",
        "camera_a": {
          "x": 42.01754385964932,
          "y": 180.29824561403507,
          "width": 1246.9649122807014,
          "height": 701.4177631578946,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "camera_b": {
          "x": 8.982456140350678,
          "y": 310.3059210526312,
          "width": 4087.0175438596493,
          "height": 2298.947368421053,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "pan_duration": 13.0,
        "crossfade_duration": 1.0,
        "easing": "linear",
        "audio": "assets/cutscenes/M3C2I4V.mp3",
        "audio_volume": 0.75,
        "audio_start_delay": 0.0,
        "music": "",
        "music_volume": 0.4,
        "music_start_delay": 0.0,
        "subtitle": "It was the greatest empire in the history of the world. For a time, it seemed to be eternal. But the tides of time were relentless, and the Zjoal twilight was soon to come."
      }
    ]
  },
  "mission_4_intro": {
    "slides": [
      {
        "image": "assets/cutscenes/M4C1I1.png",
        "camera_a": {
          "x": 755.0962406015036,
          "y": 49.739849624060156,
          "width": 647.3218045112782,
          "height": 364.11851503759397,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "camera_b": {
          "x": 28.84962406015029,
          "y": 19.01203007518808,
          "width": 1469.039097744361,
          "height": 826.3344924812031,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "pan_duration": 21.0,
        "crossfade_duration": 1.0,
        "easing": "linear",
        "audio": "assets/cutscenes/M4C1I1V.mp3",
        "audio_volume": 0.75,
        "audio_start_delay": 0.0,
        "music": "",
        "music_volume": 0.4,
        "music_start_delay": 0.0,
        "subtitle": "Four generations after Aertei, the Zjoal Empire was on the brink of destruction. Conflicts among brothers and nobles created a deep divide in the Empire's politics and split it in two - the Zjoal Empire in the north and the Kerunian empire in the south."
      },
      {
        "image": "assets/cutscenes/M4C1I2.png",
        "camera_a": {
          "x": 80.64210526315793,
          "y": 314.59398496240607,
          "width": 681.1984962406015,
          "height": 383.1741541353383,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "camera_b": {
          "x": 267.5488721804511,
          "y": 137.59313909774437,
          "width": 1216.4812030075188,
          "height": 684.2706766917294,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "pan_duration": 13.5,
        "crossfade_duration": 1.0,
        "easing": "linear",
        "audio": "assets/cutscenes/M4C1I2V.mp3",
        "audio_volume": 0.75,
        "audio_start_delay": 0.0,
        "music": "",
        "music_volume": 0.4,
        "music_start_delay": 0.0,
        "subtitle": "An all-out civil war erupted between the two sister-empires. The Zjoal heartland, centered around the western coast, became a battlefield. And their colonies were not spared."
      },
      {
        "image": "assets/cutscenes/M4C1I3.png",
        "camera_a": {
          "x": 708.9007518796992,
          "y": 387.6333646616541,
          "width": 782.8285714285714,
          "height": 440.34107142857147,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "camera_b": {
          "x": 178.23759398496253,
          "y": 28.251127819548742,
          "width": 1331.96992481203,
          "height": 749.2330827067669,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "pan_duration": 17.5,
        "crossfade_duration": 1.0,
        "easing": "linear",
        "audio": "assets/cutscenes/M4C1I3V.mp3",
        "audio_volume": 0.75,
        "audio_start_delay": 0.0,
        "music": "",
        "music_volume": 0.4,
        "music_start_delay": 0.0,
        "subtitle": "The massive conflict was quickly seized upon by the oppressed nations, especially in Nordia and the former Uhmayyan lands. Nordia was soon liberated, and the Uhmayyans created a new state in their territories - Ahtep Empire."
      },
      {
        "image": "assets/cutscenes/M4C1I4.png",
        "camera_a": {
          "x": 390.1518796992482,
          "y": 630.063439849624,
          "width": 611.9052631578946,
          "height": 344.19671052631577,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "camera_b": {
          "x": 184.39699248120297,
          "y": 116.02255639097746,
          "width": 1136.4090225563912,
          "height": 639.2300751879701,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "pan_duration": 18.0,
        "crossfade_duration": 1.0,
        "easing": "linear",
        "audio": "assets/cutscenes/M4C1I4V.mp3",
        "audio_volume": 0.75,
        "audio_start_delay": 0.0,
        "music": "",
        "music_volume": 0.4,
        "music_start_delay": 0.0,
        "subtitle": "The emergence of independent Nordia and Ahtep severed all communications between the mother empire and the Zjoal Far East province, centered around city of Welthorne - led by the pious zealot of the Gods, Regnus Aevencourne."
      },
      {
        "image": "assets/cutscenes/M4C1I5.png",
        "camera_a": {
          "x": 146.85563909774436,
          "y": 31.261654135338347,
          "width": 571.8691729323308,
          "height": 321.6764097744361,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "camera_b": {
          "x": 132.04210526315785,
          "y": 88.30526315789461,
          "width": 1361.227067669173,
          "height": 765.6902255639098,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "pan_duration": 19.0,
        "crossfade_duration": 1.0,
        "easing": "linear",
        "audio": "assets/cutscenes/M4C1I5V.mp3",
        "audio_volume": 0.75,
        "audio_start_delay": 0.0,
        "music": "",
        "music_volume": 0.4,
        "music_start_delay": 0.0,
        "subtitle": "Regnus believed that the mother empire has disintegrated; and that it was the doing of those, that were unfaithful to the Gods. He eyed his neighboring kingdoms and saw, that they too, were nothing but heretics, a stain, that needed to be removed."
      },
      {
        "image": "assets/cutscenes/M4C1I6.png",
        "camera_a": {
          "x": 648.8466165413533,
          "y": 285.33684210526314,
          "width": 668.8796992481203,
          "height": 376.2448308270677,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "camera_b": {
          "x": 61.186466165413435,
          "y": 137.58045112781952,
          "width": 1432.0827067669175,
          "height": 805.5465225563911,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "pan_duration": 10.0,
        "crossfade_duration": 1.0,
        "easing": "ease_out",
        "audio": "assets/cutscenes/M4C1I6V.mp3",
        "audio_volume": 0.75,
        "audio_start_delay": 0.0,
        "music": "",
        "music_volume": 0.4,
        "music_start_delay": 0.0,
        "subtitle": "He gathered an army of his loyalists and began a crusade to purge the east from the unclean... and to build a new Empire, worthy of the Gods' favor."
      }
    ]
  },
  "mission_4_outro": {
    "slides": [
      {
        "image": "assets/cutscenes/M4C2I1.png",
        "camera_a": {
          "x": 380.91278195488724,
          "y": 51.27969924812032,
          "width": 776.6691729323309,
          "height": 436.8764097744361,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "camera_b": {
          "x": 76.6075187969924,
          "y": 88.30526315789461,
          "width": 1402.803007518797,
          "height": 789.0766917293233,
          "rotation": 0.0
        },
        "pan_duration": 19.5,
        "crossfade_duration": 1.0,
        "easing": "linear",
        "audio": "assets/cutscenes/M4C2I1V.mp3",
        "audio_volume": 0.75,
        "audio_start_delay": 0.0,
        "music": "",
        "music_volume": 0.4,
        "music_start_delay": 0.0,
        "subtitle": "Regnus, standing atop the desecrated remains of the Divine Mother's statue in Neimer, proclaimed himself Emperor. Azincourne Empire was build on the ashes of ten kingdoms. The new emperor declared himself the true heir to legacy of Serthus Diarcess."
      },
      {
        "image": "assets/cutscenes/M4C2I2.png",
        "camera_a": {
          "x": 702.7413533834584,
          "y": 14.323308270676762,
          "width": 537.9924812030077,
          "height": 302.62077067669185,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "camera_b": {
          "x": 748.2902255639098,
          "y": 409.74248120300746,
          "width": 766.5368421052635,
          "height": 431.17697368421074,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "pan_duration": 22.0,
        "crossfade_duration": 1.0,
        "easing": "linear",
        "audio": "assets/cutscenes/M4C2I2V.mp3",
        "audio_volume": 0.75,
        "audio_start_delay": 0.0,
        "music": "",
        "music_volume": 0.4,
        "music_start_delay": 0.0,
        "subtitle": "The regime in the Empire was brutal. Cultural heritage, gods and everything that made its kingdoms unique, vanished almost overnight. Regnus believed, that salvation could be found only in faith in the Azincournean Gods - led by the God of Thunder and his right hand - Regnus himself."
      },
      {
        "image": "assets/cutscenes/M4C2I3.png",
        "camera_a": {
          "x": 776.6541353383459,
          "y": 145.21052631578937,
          "width": 655.0210526315789,
          "height": 368.44934210526316,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "camera_b": {
          "x": 61.18646616541355,
          "y": 31.330827067669134,
          "width": 1338.151879699248,
          "height": 752.710432330827,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "pan_duration": 15.0,
        "crossfade_duration": 1.0,
        "easing": "linear",
        "audio": "assets/cutscenes/M4C2I3V.mp3",
        "audio_volume": 0.75,
        "audio_start_delay": 0.0,
        "music": "",
        "music_volume": 0.4,
        "music_start_delay": 0.0,
        "subtitle": "Many oppressed, however, held out on hope. They prayed to their gods in secret - hoping, that one day, the tyranny of Azincourne would be over. And the judgement day was indeed coming."
      }
    ]
  },
  "mission_5_intro": {
    "slides": [
      {
        "image": "assets/cutscenes/M5C1I1.png",
        "camera_a": {
          "x": 73.52781954887209,
          "y": 454.89060150375934,
          "width": 663.2601503759398,
          "height": 373.08383458646614,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "camera_b": {
          "x": 170.53834586466155,
          "y": 52.88872180451139,
          "width": 1300.7654135338348,
          "height": 731.6805451127822,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "pan_duration": 13.0,
        "crossfade_duration": 1.0,
        "easing": "linear",
        "audio": "assets/cutscenes/M5C1I1V.mp3",
        "audio_volume": 0.75,
        "audio_start_delay": 0.0,
        "music": "",
        "music_volume": 0.4,
        "music_start_delay": 0.0,
        "subtitle": "55 years after Regnus's death, the air was thick with tension. People of the east, yearning to be free from Azincourne's yoke, have been waiting for so long."
      },
      {
        "image": "assets/cutscenes/M5C1I2.png",
        "camera_a": {
          "x": 510.2601503759398,
          "y": 66.67819548872177,
          "width": 564.1699248120301,
          "height": 317.34558270676695,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "camera_b": {
          "x": 42.724791215799996,
          "y": 64.10503941471995,
          "width": 1458.2375939849624,
          "height": 820.2586466165413,
          "rotation": 0.0
        },
        "pan_duration": 19.5,
        "crossfade_duration": 1.0,
        "easing": "linear",
        "audio": "assets/cutscenes/M5C1I2V.mp3",
        "audio_volume": 0.75,
        "audio_start_delay": 0.0,
        "music": "",
        "music_volume": 0.4,
        "music_start_delay": 0.0,
        "subtitle": "Soon, a massive rebellion commenced. At the helm of this rebellion were young nobles - Alexius Brennhen of Noxfort and Derion Royen of Arcburg. They rallied the population and the nobles behind them and rose up against the Empire."
      },
      {
        "image": "assets/cutscenes/M5C1I3.png",
        "camera_a": {
          "x": 37.52631578947373,
          "y": 259.1593984962406,
          "width": 476.3984962406015,
          "height": 267.9741541353384,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "camera_b": {
          "x": 749.4992481203008,
          "y": 294.64511278195494,
          "width": 768,
          "height": 432,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "pan_duration": 14.0,
        "crossfade_duration": 1.0,
        "easing": "linear",
        "audio": "assets/cutscenes/M5C1I3V.mp3",
        "audio_volume": 0.75,
        "audio_start_delay": 0.0,
        "music": "",
        "music_volume": 0.4,
        "music_start_delay": 0.0,
        "subtitle": "Following suit were the peoples of the Elletic lands. The two powerful rebellions took Azincourne's stretched military by surprise - and were ready to liberate the east from its zealotry at last."
      }
    ]
  },
  "mission_5_outro": {
    "slides": [
      {
        "image": "assets/cutscenes/M5C2I1.png",
        "camera_a": {
          "x": 434.80751879699255,
          "y": 37.42105263157896,
          "width": 921,
          "height": 518,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "camera_b": {
          "x": 45.81052631578953,
          "y": 192.2578007518798,
          "width": 1453.6180451127818,
          "height": 817.6601503759398,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "pan_duration": 10.0,
        "crossfade_duration": 1.0,
        "easing": "linear",
        "audio": "assets/cutscenes/M5C2I1V.mp3",
        "audio_volume": 0.75,
        "audio_start_delay": 0.0,
        "music": "",
        "music_volume": 0.4,
        "music_start_delay": 0.0,
        "subtitle": "The First Continental War was over. And the liberators were standing victorious over the remnants of the Azincournean empire."
      },
      {
        "image": "assets/cutscenes/M5C2I2.png",
        "camera_a": {
          "x": 43.68571428571431,
          "y": 205.26466165413535,
          "width": 608.8255639097744,
          "height": 342.46437969924807,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "camera_b": {
          "x": 877.3293233082705,
          "y": 219.09624060150367,
          "width": 606.2932330827069,
          "height": 341.03994360902266,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "pan_duration": 16.0,
        "crossfade_duration": 1.0,
        "easing": "linear",
        "audio": "assets/cutscenes/M5C2I2V.mp3",
        "audio_volume": 0.75,
        "audio_start_delay": 0.0,
        "music": "",
        "music_volume": 0.4,
        "music_start_delay": 0.0,
        "subtitle": "The magnitude of the war and the subsequent changes forced the first ever conference among the kings and the nobles of the entire east - the Council of the Iron Valley, which would decide the order of the post-war world."
      },
      {
        "image": "assets/cutscenes/M5C2I3.png",
        "camera_a": {
          "x": 91.81904761904775,
          "y": 68.72412164670936,
          "width": 1408.1069340016707,
          "height": 792.0601503759398,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "camera_b": {
          "x": 392.6188805346701,
          "y": 225.07241715399607,
          "width": 573.9675856307434,
          "height": 322.8567669172932,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "pan_duration": 28.0,
        "crossfade_duration": 1.0,
        "easing": "linear",
        "audio": "assets/cutscenes/M5C2I3V.mp3",
        "audio_volume": 0.75,
        "audio_start_delay": 0.0,
        "music": "",
        "music_volume": 0.4,
        "music_start_delay": 0.0,
        "subtitle": "By decrees of the Council, five kingdoms emerged from the Empire's ashes - Kingdom of Azincourne itself, Heilonic Kingdom of Révia, Kingdom of Venexia, the Holy Kingdom of Elletia and the United Kingdom of Naragonthid. All mighty kingdoms in their own regard - but only two of them would continue to shape the destiny of the world."
      }
    ]
  },
  "mission_6_intro": {
    "slides": []
  },
  "mission_6_outro": {
    "slides": []
  }
}